# Triumph Fanfare — victory sting (2 bars, loops as short celebration).
deck 1
bpm 132

track Fanfare id fan gen gameBoyDmg * 2
  gen type pulse duty 50 env_mode constant vol 14
  note 60 0 0.25 v 120
  note 64 0.25 0.25 v 115
  note 67 0.5 0.25 v 120
  note 72 0.75 0.5 v 127
  note 67 1.25 0.25 v 110
  note 72 1.5 0.5 v 127
  note 76 2 0.25 v 120
  note 74 2.25 0.25 v 115
  note 72 2.5 0.25 v 120
  note 67 2.75 0.25 v 110
  note 72 3 1 v 127
  note 60 4 0.25 v 115
  note 64 4.25 0.25 v 110
  note 67 4.5 0.25 v 120
  note 72 4.75 0.5 v 127
  note 76 5.25 0.25 v 120
  note 79 5.5 0.5 v 127
  note 76 6 0.25 v 115
  note 74 6.25 0.25 v 110
  note 72 6.5 1.5 v 127

track Harmony id harm gen gameBoyDmg * 2
  gen type pulse duty 25 env_mode constant vol 8
  note 48 0 1 v 90
  note 52 1 1 v 95
  note 55 2 1 v 100
  note 60 3 1 v 110
  note 48 4 1 v 90
  note 52 5 1 v 95
  note 55 6 0.5 v 100
  note 60 6.5 1.5 v 115

track Bass id bass gen gameBoyDmg * 2
  gen type wave wave_shape square vol 13
  note 36 0 1 v 120
  note 40 1 1 v 110
  note 43 2 1 v 120
  note 36 3 1 v 127
  note 36 4 1 v 120
  note 40 5 1 v 110
  note 43 6 0.5 v 120
  note 48 6.5 1.5 v 127

track Crash id crash gen gbaDirectSound * 2
  gen waveform triangle vol 12 bitcrush true
  adsr a 0 d 0.25 s 0 r 0.2
  note 96 0.75 0.3 v 110
  note 96 3 0.35 v 127
  note 96 5.5 0.25 v 100
  note 96 6.5 0.4 v 120
